---
import SectionWrapper from '../ui/SectionWrapper.astro';
import '../../styles/components/our-work-volume.css';
---

<SectionWrapper background="light" class="our-work-section our-work-volume-section">
  <section id="initiatives" class="container container-wide our-work-volume" aria-labelledby="initiatives-title">
    <header class="our-work-volume-heading">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">THE COLLECTION · VOL. 01</p>
        <h2 id="initiatives-title">Initiatives</h2>
      </div>
      <p>Work takes shape in the environments we create. This volume documents learning spaces designed to invite participation, support discovery, and bring ideas into everyday experience.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="work-volume" data-work-volume="initiatives">
      <div class="work-volume-cover" data-volume-cover>
        <div class="work-volume-cover-art" aria-hidden="true">
          <img src="/media/classroom-poster.webp" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
          <span class="work-volume-cover-wash"></span>
          <span class="work-volume-cover-index">01</span>
          <span class="work-volume-cover-rule"></span>
          <span class="work-volume-cover-mark">E / D</span>
        </div>
        <div class="work-volume-cover-copy">
          <p class="work-volume-kicker">E DEVISER · FIELD NOTES</p>
          <h3>Spaces for<br />what comes next.</h3>
          <p class="work-volume-cover-description">A closer look at the learning environments taking shape through our initiatives.</p>
          <div class="work-volume-cover-meta">
            <span>VOLUME 01</span>
            <span>INITIATIVES</span>
          </div>
          <button class="work-volume-open" type="button" data-volume-open aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="initiatives-book-content">
            <span>Open volume</span><span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
          </button>
        </div>
        <span class="work-volume-spine" aria-hidden="true"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="work-volume-content" id="initiatives-book-content" data-volume-content hidden>
        <div class="work-volume-toolbar">
          <div class="work-volume-location">
            <span class="work-volume-kicker">THE COLLECTION / 01</span>
            <span data-volume-counter aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true">01 / 03</span>
          </div>
          <button class="work-volume-close" type="button" data-volume-close>
            <span>Close volume</span><span aria-hidden="true">×</span>
          </button>
        </div>

        <div class="work-volume-pages">
          <article class="work-volume-spread is-active" data-volume-page="0" aria-hidden="false">
            <div class="work-volume-page-copy">
              <p class="work-volume-page-label">01 / THE ENVIRONMENT</p>
              <h3>Learning, made tangible.</h3>
              <p>Learning environments are more than rooms. They shape how people gather, participate, ask questions, and engage with new ideas.</p>
              <p>This classroom is one of the spaces documented in our initiatives—a real setting, presented as part of the work rather than as a concept rendering.</p>
              <span class="work-volume-page-foot">INITIATIVES · FIELD DOCUMENTATION</span>
            </div>
            <figure class="work-volume-page-media work-volume-page-media--hero">
              <img src="/media/classroom-poster.webp" alt="Documented classroom learning environment" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
              <figcaption><span>01.01</span> A classroom learning environment</figcaption>
            </figure>
          </article>

          <article class="work-volume-spread" data-volume-page="1" aria-hidden="true" hidden>
            <div class="work-volume-page-copy">
              <p class="work-volume-page-label">02 / ROOM TO DISCOVER</p>
              <h3>Different spaces. Different possibilities.</h3>
              <p>A library creates a different rhythm: a place to explore, focus, and follow a question further.</p>
              <p>Seen alongside the classroom, it adds another perspective to the learning environments represented in this volume.</p>
              <span class="work-volume-page-foot">INITIATIVES · LEARNING SPACES</span>
            </div>
            <div class="work-volume-page-gallery">
              <figure>
                <img src="/media/library-poster.webp" alt="Documented library learning environment" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                <figcaption><span>01.02</span> A space for discovery</figcaption>
              </figure>
              <figure>
                <img src="/media/classroom-entrance.webp" alt="Entrance to a classroom learning space" loading="lazy" decoding="async" />
                <figcaption><span>01.03</span> Designed for participation</figcaption>
              </figure>
            </div>
          </article>

          <article class="work-volume-spread" data-volume-page="2" aria-hidden="true" hidden>
            <div class="work-volume-page-copy">
              <p class="work-volume-page-label">03 / INSIDE THE SPACE</p>
              <h3>See the environment in use.</h3>
              <p>Still images offer a view. A walkthrough gives the space its context—its layout, details, and the way its parts come together.</p>
              <span class="work-volume-page-foot">INITIATIVES · VIDEO DOCUMENTATION</span>
            </div>
            <div class="work-volume-video-pair">
              <figure>
                <video controls preload="none" poster="/media/classroom-poster.webp" playsinline>
                  <source src="/media/classroom-walkthrough-720p.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
                  Your browser does not support the video element.
                </video>
                <figcaption><span>01.04</span> Classroom walkthrough</figcaption>
              </figure>
              <figure>
                <video controls preload="none" poster="/media/library-poster.webp" playsinline>
                  <source src="/media/library-excerpt-720p.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
                  Your browser does not support the video element.
                </video>
                <figcaption><span>01.05</span> Library excerpt</figcaption>
              </figure>
            </div>
          </article>
        </div>

        <div class="work-volume-navigation">
          <button type="button" data-volume-prev disabled aria-label="Previous spread"><span aria-hidden="true">←</span><span>Previous</span></button>
          <div class="work-volume-progress" role="group" aria-label="Choose a spread">
            <button type="button" data-volume-go="0" class="is-active" aria-label="Go to spread 1" aria-current="step"></button>
            <button type="button" data-volume-go="1" aria-label="Go to spread 2"></button>
            <button type="button" data-volume-go="2" aria-label="Go to spread 3"></button>
          </div>
          <button type="button" data-volume-next><span>Next</span><span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</SectionWrapper>

